//
// The following changes to existing nodes would integrate the
// new arcs cleanly. No existing node content needs to be
// deleted — only new choice entries or next-pointer updates.
//
// 1. pb_ghost_warden_office  (or pb_ghost_torres_files)
//    ADD a choice leading to pb_architect_leverage:
//    {text:`Search the storage annex behind the warden's outer office — Rico mentioned a false panel.`,
//     next:'pb_architect_leverage',effects:{stats:{per:1,int:1}}}
//    Rationale: The architect's leverage discovery fits naturally as
